# Help: keys (F1 for more)
%Y %KEsc %WThe menu, with the whole chat log
%Y %KEnter %WSend what you have typed
%Y %KF1 %WThe next help page
%pFlying
%Y %KB_LEFT %WTurn anticlockwise
%Y %KB_RIGHT %WTurn clockwise
%Y %KB_FORWARD %WThrust
%Y %KB_REVERSE %WThrust backwards
%Y %KB_AFTERBURNERS %WAfterburners, while held
%pWeapons
%Y %KB_BULLET %WGuns
%Y %KB_BOMB %WBomb
%Y %KB_MINE %WMine
%Y %KB_THOR %WThor's hammer
%Y %KB_BURST %WBurst
# Help: keys (F1 for more)
%pEquipment, on and off
%Y %KB_STEALTH %WStealth
%Y %KB_CLOAK %WCloak
%Y %KB_XRADAR %WX-radar
%Y %KB_ANTIWARP %WAntiwarp
%Y %KB_MULTI %WGuns fire singly or in a spread
%pActions
%Y %KB_REPEL %WRepel
%Y %KB_WARP %WWarp, or go to your portal
%Y %KB_PORTAL %WSet a portal
%Y %KB_DECOY %WDecoy
%Y %KB_ROCKET %WRocket
%Y %KB_BRICK %WWall brick
%Y %KB_ATTACH %WRide as a turret, or stop
%Y %KB_VIEWMAP %WThe whole map, while held
%pOther keys
%Y %KB_CYCLE %WPlayer list: the next view
%Y %KB_PREV %WPlayer list: previous player
%Y %KB_NEXT %WPlayer list: next player
%Y %KB_PLAY %WSpectator mode on and off
%Y %KB_SHOW_FPS %WFrame rate and ping; again for more
%Y %KB_ZOOM_IN %WZoom in
%Y %KB_ZOOM_OUT %WZoom out
%Y %KB_SCREENSHOT %WScreenshot
# Help: chat (F1 for more)
%WThere is no key to start a message. Type, and the
%Wletters go to the chat line; Enter sends it.
%pWho reads it
%Y text           %WEveryone in this arena
%Y 'text  //text  %WYour team
%Y "text          %WThe picked player's team
%Y /text          %WThe picked player only
%Y :name:text     %WThat player, anywhere in the zone
%Y ::text         %WWhoever last wrote to you
%Y #text          %WYour squad
%Y ;text  ;2;text %WChat channel 1, or channel 2
%Y =3             %WMove to team 3
%WThe picked player is the one PgUp and PgDn choose in
%Wthe player list. Tab finishes a name after the first
%W:, and pressing : again goes back through the last
%Wfive players who wrote to you.
# Help: zone commands (F1 for more)
%WThese go to the zone, which answers them. Zones
%Wdiffer: %Y?help%W asks yours what it has.
%Y ?arena         %WThe arenas here, to pick one from
%Y ?go name       %WGo to that arena
%Y ?time          %WTime left in this game
%Y ?flags         %WWho is holding flags
%Y ?score         %WThe score, in a ball game
%Y ?buy           %WWhat you can buy here
%Y ?buy item      %WBuy it
%Y ?find name     %WWhere that player is
%Y ?chat=a,b      %WJoin the chat channels a and b
%Y ?help message  %WAsk the zone's staff for help
